\label{thm:probability-strong-law-large-numbers}
若\(X_1,X_2,\ldots\)独立同分布，且\(\mathbb{E}[|X_1|]<\infty\)，则
\[ \overline{X}_n
  =\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_i\to_{\mathrm{a.s.}}\mathbb{E}[X_1]. \]
\end{theorem}

